- Where we goin'? Dr.SCHULTZ I hear at least two of them are overseeing up in Gatlinburg, but I don't know where. That means we visit every plantation in Gatlinburg till we find them. And when we find them, you point them out, and I kill them. You do that, I agree to give you your freedom... . twenty-five dollars per Brittle brother - that's seventy-five dollars... . your horse, Tony even though I've already gave him to you -- but once the final Brittle brother lies dead in the dust, I'll buy you a new saddle, and a new suit of clothes, handsome cowboy hat included. Dr.Schultz's eyes go to the saloon window. Dr.SCHULTZ And as if on cue... . here comes the sheriff.
- ພວກເຮົາຈະໄປໃສ? ດຣ ຊູລຕສ໌ ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ຍິນວ່າຢ່າງຫນ້ອຍສອງຄົນຂອງພວກເຂົາ ກໍາ ລັງເບິ່ງແຍງຢູ່ກັດລິນບີກ, ແຕ່ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າຢູ່ໃສ. ນັ້ນ ຫມາຍ ຄວາມວ່າພວກເຮົາໄປຢ້ຽມຢາມປູກພືດທຸກແຫ່ງໃນກາດລິນເບີກຈົນກວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະຊອກຫາພວກມັນ
